  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1176",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-13T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-13T02:17:10.489Z",
    "meteorologist": "Saroj Pudasainee",
    "analysis_np": "हाल नेपालमा उपल्लो वायुमण्डलमा रहेको पश्चिमी न्युन चापीय रेखा (trough), स्थानीय वायू तथा पूर्वीय वायूको समेत आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Nepal is currently under the partial influence of the western low-pressure trough in the upper atmosphere, local winds, and easterly winds.",
    "today_np": "कोशी प्रदेश लगायत देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ। कोशी प्रदेश लगायत बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही स्थानहरू, लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदुरपश्चिमका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरू तथा बाँकी तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country, including Koshi Province, while partly cloudy conditions are likely over the remaining Terai region. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at some places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces, and at one or two places in the remaining Terai region.",
    "tomorrow_np": "कोशी प्रदेश लगायत बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ, मधेश प्रदेश लगायत बाँकी हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल तथा तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ। कोशी प्रदेशका केही स्थानहरूमा, मधेश प्रदेश लगायत बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानहरूमा तथा बाँकी पहाडी र हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यम वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना रहेको छ । कोशी प्रदेशका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको समेत सम्भावना रहेको छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Madhesh Province and the remaining Hilly and Himalayan regions, while the weather will remain mainly fair over the Terai region. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at some places in Koshi Province, at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, and at one or two places in the remaining Hilly and Himalayan regions. There is also a possibility of heavy rainfall at one or two places in Koshi Province.",
    "special": ""
  }
